{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SOK MAX is a sokoban classic puzzle game, the sequel of the SOK puzzle. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/786820/extras/0294b03cf8823ff183c21586ff451818.avif?t=1775835747\" width=616 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Now there are more boxes on each level. The goal of the game is to move all the boxes to their positions. It's not as easy as it seems. The player can push one box at a time, but do not pull it off.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/786820/extras/15a0c82f218c06081eed4a60598224dc.avif?t=1775835747\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\u2705 Fascinating gameplay;<br></li><li>\u2705 50 awesome levels with more boxes on each level;<br></li><li>\u2705 No background music, just You and the Game;<br></li><li>\u2705 53 meme  achievements;<br></li><li>\u2705 Cloud Saves;<br></li><li>\u2705 Free DLC now available: a complete Remake of the game with new features!<br></li><li> <i>Trading cards, backgrounds &amp; emoticons: will be added as soon as it becomes available, according to the rules of Steam.</i></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/786820/extras/2d32a87c17e148aa4c943c35ac7c70b2.avif?t=1775835747\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><br>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"255556060778b5152faf88ab8d576e116d168723.jpg","localized_name":"SOK MAX","name":"SOK MAX","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/786820/25555606